WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
The alarm went

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.980
off in 12 minutes,

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:02.400
the auto

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.100
stop didn't,

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.760
it kept running

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:04.340
for two and

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.200
a half hours.
